'' AN fb_ NAME THAT IS NO RUNTIME PROCEDURE IS UNDECLARED. Every fb_ name was exempt from
'' TKO0743, so 's = fb_StrRemove( s, "_" )' -- fb/string.bi's ALIAS for FB.Remove, which
'' declares nothing by that name -- bound nothing and stopped the build with an internal
'' compiler error instead (TKO0994). fbc says 42 for it and for 'fb_NoSuchThing', and
'' accepts the real runtime's 'fb_ArrayRedimEx'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/fb-name-not-runtime.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb-name-not-runtime.bas(5,5): error TKO0743: 'fb_strremove' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: fb-name-not-runtime.bas(6,5): error TKO0743: 'fb_nosuchthing' is not declared
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
